Sharn is the largest city in [[Khorvaire]] and the commercial and cultural heart of [[Breland]]. Known as the City of Towers, it rises from the cliffs above the [[Dagger River]] in breathtaking vertical tiers.

Sharn sits upon a [[manifest zone]] tied to [[Syrania]], the Azure Sky, which empowers flight and levitation magic throughout the city. This is what allows its towers to reach heights impossible elsewhere.

!! Districts (notable)
* [[Upper Central]] — seat of power, wealthy enclave, City Council
* [[Middle Dura]] — merchants, working class, adventurers
* [[Lower Dura]] — poverty, crime, home to [[The Boromar Clan]]
* [[Callestan]] — underworld hub, known for [[The Whisper]]'s operations
* [[Fallen]] — ruined district in Lower Dura, lawless

!! Governance
Ruled by the Lord Mayor (currently [[Cathan ir'Demell]]), but true power lies with the [[City Council]] and the dragonmarked houses. The [[Sharn Watch]] maintains order with variable effectiveness.

!! Connections
* [[Breland]] (national capital)
* [[House Orien]] (lightning rail terminus, trade)
* [[House Sivis]] (message stations)
* [[The Boromar Clan]] (criminal control of Lower Dura)
